-atlas/wisconsin/clark-county"],["ARC or PLC in Clark County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/clark-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle ran 48% of normal in January to February and 55% in September to October. Grid 29857 had its driest year in 1976 at 54% of normal. A preliminary estimate for grid 29557 puts July to August 2026 at 66.9.</p>"}
